sequenceDiagram

  actor 2 as Contributor<br />[Person]
  participant 7 as App (PWA)<br />[Container: HTML, CSS, ES modules checked by tsc, vendored Leaflet 1.9, Preact and htm]
  participant 24 as On-device store<br />[Container: IndexedDB]
  participant 48 as Image bucket<br />[Container: Garage (S3-compatible), on the VPS]
  participant 27 as API server<br />[Container: TypeScript on Node 22, Fastify, Zod, Kysely]
  participant 47 as Database<br />[Container: PostgreSQL 16 with PostGIS 3.4]
  actor 3 as Editor<br />[Person]
  participant 70 as EU email service<br />[Software System]
  participant 51 as Export job<br />[Container: Node 22, git with a deploy key]
  participant 78 as rodokmen-export repo<br />[Container: Git: Markdown notes, family.ged]

  2->>7: Writes a Draft without signal, with a photo of the register page<br />[Browser]
  7->>24: Keeps the Draft and the photo<br />[IndexedDB]
  7->>48: Back online: uploads the photo to pending/<br />[HTTPS PUT and GET at files.<domain>, presigned links]
  7->>27: Submits it: typed operations, base versions, idempotency key<br />[JSON/HTTPS, session cookie]
  27->>47: Stores it as pending#59; only its author and the Editors see it<br />[SQL]
  3->>7: Opens the review queue, fixes a misread year and accepts<br />[Browser]
  7->>27: Accepts the whole Proposal with the correction<br />[JSON/HTTPS, session cookie]
  27->>47: One transaction: applies the operations, bumps versions, logs before and after<br />[SQL]
  27->>70: Emails the author the outcome in their language<br />[SMTP, STARTTLS]
  51->>47: Overnight: reads the Tree<br />[SQL]
  51->>78: Commits changed notes and family.ged, Living people reduced<br />[Git over SSH, deploy key]